# Line endings are part of what this repository is.
#
# `check.sh` compares the pages with what `tools/docs` writes from `api.json`,
# and a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites every text file.
# The comparison then fails for the line endings and not for the documentation.
# `eol=lf` makes the working tree the same bytes on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
